{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10417","headline":"自淇涉黄河途中作十三首 十三 · 高适","name":"自淇涉黄河途中作十三首 十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"皤皤河滨叟，相遇似有耻。\n辍榜聊问之，荅言尽终结。\n一生虽贫贱，九十年未死。\n且喜对儿孙，弥慙远城市。\n结庐黄河曲，垂钓长河里。\n漫漫望云沙，萧条听风水。\n所思强饭食，永愿在乡里。\n万事吾不知，其心只如此。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10417.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10417","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}